{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1213", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1213/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1213/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1213/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1213", "id": 716938297, "node_id": "MDU6SXNzdWU3MTY5MzgyOTc=", "number": 1213, "title": "Offboard disabled when processing other components heartbeat", "user": {"login": "yhabib29", "id": 45459186, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDU5MTg2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45459186?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29", "html_url": "https://github.com/yhabib29", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977267, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNjc=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/bug", "name": "bug", "color": "ee0701", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 3, "created_at": "2020-10-08T00:38:06Z", "updated_at": "2020-10-27T15:20:21Z", "closed_at": "2020-10-27T15:20:21Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "When using Offboard plugin, I have noticed that the plugin is processing heartbeats coming from other components on the same system (Camera, Gimbal, ...).\r\nMy workaround is to filter Heartbeats mavlink message based on the message component ID, using default Autopilot value MAV_COMP_ID_AUTOPILOT1.\r\n\r\nI just added these lines at the beginning of the \"process_heartbeat\" function:\r\n```\r\nvoid OffboardImpl::process_heartbeat(const mavlink_message_t& message)\r\n{\r\n    // Process only Heartbeat coming from the autopilot\r\n    if (message.compid != MAV_COMP_ID_AUTOPILOT1) {\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n```", "closed_by": {"login": "yhabib29", "id": 45459186, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDU5MTg2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45459186?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29", "html_url": "https://github.com/yhabib29", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/yhabib29/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1213/reactions